# SizeKit — Monetization

**Model:** Free + ads, plus a **one-time lifetime Pro** purchase (~$7.99, market-testable).  
**Do NOT** add monthly subscriptions unless the product owner explicitly changes strategy.

## Ads

- Isolate behind an `AdService` abstraction; never scatter provider SDKs in feature code
- Never interrupt critical flows or make core tools unusable
- No fake buttons, dark patterns, or ads that look like system UI

## Pro

- Isolate entitlement behind a simple abstraction (`UserEntitlements.isPro` / purchase service)
- Don't overbuild billing before purchase flow is implemented
- Pro candidates: no ads, unlimited exact-size, batch, advanced presets/PDF, metadata removal

## Business constraints

Target ~$1,500+/month revenue without proportional infra cost. Prefer options that stay offline, private, low-cost, and maintainable. No dark patterns to force upgrades.
